 "text": "Hi, How are you holding up? That's usually due to grease or dirt on the pedals, rather than the bike itself. Try cleaning them and wiping them dry, then see if the noise stops. If the pedals are really bad, you can strip them down and re grease them, but usually a good clean and re grease does the trick. Peel off any plastic strips and spread little oil on the pedals with a small spoon or tool. Then wipe everything clean and see if the noise goes away. Clean it first, then clean off any grease and get it as dry as possible. A little does no harm, just don't over do it or you' end up with sticky pedals. A thin film of grease is usually just right.",
